---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'August 26, 2026';
const contactEmail = 'hello@startinvestingsimple.com';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms and conditions governing your use of Start Investing Simple."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 prose prose-invert max-w-none prose-a:text-brand prose-strong:text-paper">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</em></p>

    <p>
      By accessing or using startinvestingsimple.com ("the Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use.
      If you do not agree, please do not use the Site.
    </p>

    <h2>Use of Content</h2>
    <p>
      All content on this Site, including text, graphics, logos, and calculators, is owned by Start Investing
      Simple unless otherwise noted, and is provided for personal, non-commercial use. You may not reproduce,
      distribute, or republish content without our prior written permission.
    </p>

    <h2>No Professional Advice</h2>
    <p>
      Content on this Site is educational and general in nature. It does not constitute financial, investment,
      tax, or legal advice. See our <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a> for more detail.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      The Site and its content are provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. To the fullest extent
      permitted by law, Start Investing Simple shall not be liable for any damages arising from your use of, or
      inability to use, the Site or reliance on any information provided.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>
      The Site may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or
      practices of those sites.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these Terms of Use from time to time. Continued use of the Site after changes are posted
      constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms? Contact us at <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
